# A checker must not write into the tree it checks: a tracked stamp file here
# dirtied the shared checkout and dispatcher.sh refuses to build on a dirty
# tree, so a guard stalled 129 builds. The high-water mark is derived from git
# history now; this line is belt-and-braces.
docs/testing/.territory_wave
